*.csv
# ...except this one: it's source (keyword -> category rules the finance
# categorizer reads), not downloaded financial data — the *.csv rule above
# was catching it too, which is why it was never committed and every fresh
# clone/deploy silently lost transaction categorization until this fix.
!backend/src/swing_trade_ml/services/finance/category_rules.csv
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.h5

